   "fieldtype": "HTML",
   "options": "<div class=\"llm-provider-hero\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Provider setup\"><span class=\"llm-hero-badge\">API connection</span><div class=\"llm-model-hero-title\">LLM provider</div><p class=\"llm-model-hero-text\">Set <strong>Base URL</strong> and <strong>API key</strong>; add gateway or vendor headers in the grid. Use <strong>Tools → Import from cURL</strong> to paste a full request and pre-fill fields.</p><ol class=\"llm-hero-steps\" role=\"list\"><li><span class=\"llm-hero-step-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1</span><span>Paste cURL or type the API root manually.</span></li><li><span class=\"llm-hero-step-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2</span><span>Review headers; Bearer maps to API key when possible.</span></li><li><span class=\"llm-hero-step-num\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3</span><span>Save — headers sync to JSON for the runtime bridge.</span></li></ol></div>"
